{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And all their host</b>. The host of the earth is those that were mentioned — living creatures, creeping things, fish, and all vegetation, as well as man. And the host of the heavens is the two great luminaries and the stars that were mentioned, as in \"lest you lift up your eyes to heaven and see the sun and the moon and the stars, all the host of heaven\" (Deuteronomy 4:19). It also includes the separate intelligences, as in \"I saw YHWH sitting on His throne and all the host of heaven standing by Him\" (I Kings 22:19), and likewise \"YHWH will punish the host of the height in the height\" (Isaiah 24:21). Now there is here a hint concerning the creation of the angels within the work of Creation. Likewise, human souls are the host of the heavens."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:23:44.994683122Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}